  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILK support to the BES-Net II project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BES-Net II (2020-2028) aims to formalize the scientists-policymakers-practitioners partnership and strengthen synergy and complementarity in their BES-related decisions, actions and subsequent impacts in target countries. UNESCO is tasked with enhancing connections between policy, science and indigenous and local knowledge within BES-Net II activities, for improved outcomes for biodiversity and indigenous peoples and local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
